Step 2: Create Compatible Storage Classes (if needed)

# Create a storage class on destination cluster that matches source
cat << EOF > /tmp/migration-storage-class.yaml
apiVersion: storage.k8s.io/v1
kind: StorageClass
metadata:
  name: migration-storage
